// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'pattern'. Valid alternatives: ['executions']
//
// The reverse of neg-service-runtimecomponents-in-execution.pure: a Service keyword inside
// an ExecutionEnvironment. `execEnvs` is `EXEC_ENV qualifiedName { executions }` -- ONE arm,
// no options -- so pattern, documentation, execution and testSuites are all illegal here.
//
// A rewritten parser that treats ###Service as "one element shape with optional fields"
// accepts this and produces an ExecutionEnvironment carrying a pattern that legend-engine
// has no field for.
###Service
ExecutionEnvironment fixture::neg::EnvWithPattern
{
   pattern: '/fixture/neg/env';
   executions:
   [
      UAT:
      {
         mapping: fixture::neg::Mapping;
         runtime: fixture::neg::Runtime;
      }
   ];
}
